      "text": "# dsh-danus bundle:插入全部 Danus 插件行,按包名子路径(经 node_modules junction\n# 解析;bundle 内路径必须可被 imports 解析,不能是 --patch 用的 file:///相对)。\n# 各 profile 用 id-targeted 行覆写 config(role/main 等)。\n- insert:\n    # 包名锚点入口:让 client-modules 扫描器以 options.name == 'dsh-danus' 发现本包\n    # 的 client half(src/client → lib/client.js)。必须 name 恰好等于包名,子路径\n    # 入口做不到 —— 详见 src/plugins/client.ts 注释。\n    - id: dsh-danus\n      name: 'dsh-danus'\n    - id: danus-verify-service\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/verify-service.ts'\n      config:\n        timeoutSeconds: 900\n    - id: danus-swarm-service\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/swarm-service.ts'\n    - id: danus-gateway\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/gateway.ts'\n    - id: danus-orchestration\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/orchestration.ts'\n    - id: danus-heartbeat\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/heartbeat.ts'\n    - id: danus-paper\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/paper.ts'\n    - id: danus-summary\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/summary.ts'\n    - id: danus-observability\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/observability.ts'\n    - id: danus-console-api\n      name: 'dsh-danus/src/plugins/console-api.ts'\n"
